#: scenario5:scenario5_75C07A29_C01E_4B8A_89D6_B8CBC2D40686
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b5f87ddd577f58162ea8e70264c33ea37ec3c385e41b6e5b31c9dab20990b6ca
#. default-sha256: 85730a09f9da668b39fdef535763a425693337c7e925ddb47cce7226fa3b10a2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_75C07A29_C01E_4B8A_89D6_B8CBC2D40686"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Giselle didn’t recover for some time "
"after I managed to get her inside. ⟪k:11⟫Unsure what else I could do for her,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Giselle non si riprese per un bel po’, "
"dopo essere riuscito a farla entrare."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5E3A5592_8060_41EB_BC69_E08FE5260F40
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d25abe510f19ddc4e15e4b8af50c9b98ce22e29516a779dc96e371d2bbcf128f
#. default-sha256: 9bcd8db33c6de45c0b9b84ca07b5c9ecac3991c5798d659a8a60980ff71faa63
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5E3A5592_8060_41EB_BC69_E08FE5260F40"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had her sit before the fireplace and waited in silence as she sobbed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Insicuro su cos’altro avrei dovuto fare per lei, la feci sedere accanto al caminetto, "
"aspettando in silenzio mentre piangeva."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C5F59D36_BBD5_4935_BED2_38B5B1977943
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 533d9782d38e1e557a0331321e38cd6f46a113fc2bededc6e5fd0d3b7871a467
#. default-sha256: 34abaddf5f06b538c92472baba04d75ec39ec36406dfdd32c8dae778fe69a41d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C5F59D36_BBD5_4935_BED2_38B5B1977943"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had no idea what one was supposed to say to someone who was crying."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non sapevo cosa si dovesse dire a una persona in lacrime."

#: scenario5:scenario5_133846E6_A6C0_4A08_9035_F8D79CDAA20A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 32018e1c76eafc1351f4f6341e454a092c6cc3d865949ea559cfc9bf8cc4d353
#. default-sha256: f4003f71bfc010b1edc7d7b3741f91151d8239adc30812d84271bbed0bf34f35
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_133846E6_A6C0_4A08_9035_F8D79CDAA20A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Was it normal to offer them a warm drink? ⟪k:1⟫I didn’t know."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sarebbe stato opportuno offrirle qualcosa di caldo da bere?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non ne avevo idea."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A50EF3F8_025D_4A44_B855_E041CE1DBF29
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 33da190db4cc8217219e976070293e529373111ee8eaa56b499c4892901f0fd5
#. default-sha256: c4733fe10c43b9c006ece49f8fa153f94429ae3629dfe1f7985fe105d7481abe
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A50EF3F8_025D_4A44_B855_E041CE1DBF29"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I ⟪k:1⟫did⟪k:2⟫ know I needed to reflect on the things she had said outside and try to make "
"sense of them,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ciò che sapevo, però, era che avevo bisogno di riflettere sulle cose che aveva detto davanti "
"alla villa, e cercare di dargli un senso,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_41884D0C_E62C_4552_9297_0CB1123236FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4d9866985bbf56fbcc863eca3042321d97c38e88cd9e67b176575a3d531fd04f
#. default-sha256: 99ce3fae96c00908eb5f10f5effcca9b888a9649919f869487308a38dd0846fa
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_41884D0C_E62C_4552_9297_0CB1123236FF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and from there, calm myself down and prepare for the conversation we were to have—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"as unpleasant as I was sure it would be."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫e da lì, calmarmi e prepararmi alla conversazione che avremmo avuto—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫per quanto "
"spiacevole sarebbe sicuramente stata."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F7385662_6EF7_4B14_BBFC_FE0FF5D9D8FB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9cd538bdfc6f89bf3da48322f71657c95ec6a05ba30d4bd7eb615c1e2ab243b6
#. default-sha256: cb921707f11973b908f91c6c36e5dbe4c6a993b69436d507be1e0d5850de9bed
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F7385662_6EF7_4B14_BBFC_FE0FF5D9D8FB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...A considerable amount of time later, Giselle’s sobbing drew to a stop, an oppressive "
"silence stepping in to take its place."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Passò parecchio, prima che i singhiozzi di Giselle si interrompessero, e a quel punto un "
"silenzio opprimente prese il loro posto."

