msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Will you still believe me, even then?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Mi crederesti lo stesso anche in quel caso?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_AA91C65B_A98A_4CE6_834C_9A601C41430B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
