#: scenario5:scenario5_F9C0B753_0296_4AAF_AEBF_3F05F0F460F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: deb34d1b1d5e8342dce81de7e069b043ae2c4a936cfc2671ec459cde5114d8c0
