msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I am... ⟪k:1⟫Antonin’s son. ⟪k:2⟫His blood flows through me.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Can you honestly say "
"you ⟪k:5⟫don’t⟪k:6⟫ find me revolting?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫That you’re willing to forgive me for that?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Io... ⟪k:1⟫sono il figlio di Antonin. ⟪k:2⟫Il suo sangue scorre dentro di me.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"Vorresti dire che non mi trovi rivoltante?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Che sei intenzionata a perdonarmi nonostante "
"tutto?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_521A55BC_2565_4EBA_9FF7_3218D6A73D59
