msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫While a little light through the window isn’t much of a problem, I can’t be outside, "
"directly under the sun, for more than a couple hours."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Sebbene un po’ di luce attraverso la finestra non rappresenti un problema, non posso "
"stare all’aperto per più di due ore."

#: scenario5:scenario5_ACAEB485_D2A2_4965_9E2A_4A21437C5968
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5332ee9450548bc01aa9d552bc0d38ad7836e22dcdacd0fccde02a9ff628808f
