"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫so she banished me to this mansion until my curse was broken.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫That was ten "
"years ago."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫e così mi ha esiliato in questa villa,⟪k:2⟫finché la mia maledizione non sarebbe stata "
"debellata.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Questo è successo dieci anni fa."

